# POSIP frontend components

**SSoT:** `syilex-frontend/src/components/common/` — cek folder sebelum bikin baru.

## Catalog (wajib reuse)

| Component | Pakai untuk |
|-----------|-------------|
| `DataTableHeader` | Header list: search + export |
| `DetailDialog` + `DetailItem` + `DetailTable` | Detail dokumen (tabel di dialog = `DetailTable`, **bukan** DataTable PrimeVue) |
| `ImageUpload` | Upload gambar produk/dll |
| `SerialUnitPicker` | Pilih SN/unit di baris dokumen (bukan buat baris baru) |
| `ProductUnitPickerDrawer` | Cari produk × unit (Sales/PO/retur/PBS header) |
| `SerialLabelPrintDialog` | Cetak label serial |
| `CustomerFormDialog` | Tambah/edit customer cepat |
| `MoneySummaryPanel` | Ringkasan nominal (hutang/piutang/dll) |
| `AgingBucketPanel` | Aging bucket AR/AP |
| `ListFiltersSheet` | Sheet filter list (Toolbar `#end` / header filter — **jangan** strip `w-40` inline di mobile) |
| `CollapsibleSection` | Section form yang bisa collapse |
| `RowActionButtons` | Aksi baris (edit/hapus/…) |

## Mobile / Dialog

- Filter list/laporan: `ListFiltersSheet` + `.list-filter-control` + `fluid`; SelectButton mode di **luar** sheet
- Dialog shell: `_responsive.scss` ≤991px `.p-dialog { max-width: 95vw }` — jangan mass-add `:breakpoints`
- Isi dialog multi-kolom: `grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2` (bukan `grid-cols-2` keras)
- Dialog tinggi (Role matrix): `maxHeight: 90vh` + `contentStyle` overflow
- Footer tombol: `.p-dialog-footer` (+ child `.flex`) wrap; `DetailDialog` stack/`flex-wrap`; form aksi `flex-wrap justify-end`

## Composables (wajib)

| Composable | Pakai untuk |
|------------|-------------|
| `useFormatters` | Uang, qty, tanggal, `shouldUppercase` |
| `useNotification` | Toast — **jangan** `toast.add()`; error API → `notify.apiError` |
| `useMasterCrud` | List/CRUD master + confirm |
| `useTransactionList` | List dokumen approve/delete |
| `usePosCart` | Keranjang POS saja |
| `useReceiptPdf` / `useReceiptEscPos` / `usePrintAdapter` / `usePrintTransport` | Cetak thermal (`composables/print/`) |
| `useSalesInvoicePdf` | Faktur penjualan BO |
| `useSerialLabelPrint` | Label serial |
| `useExportPdf` / `useBarcodePrint` | Export A4 / barcode |
| `useSessionGuard` | Session/auth helpers |
| `useErrorLogger` | Error FE → API |

## JANGAN

- Component/composable baru tanpa cek catalog di atas
- `DataTable` PrimeVue di dalam `DetailDialog`
- Duplikasi picker produk/SN — pakai drawer/picker existing
- `class="hidden md:…"` langsung di `Tag`/`Button` — bungkus `<div class="hidden md:flex">` (display komponen menang)
